---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../content/facts";
const updated = "October 11, 2026";
---
<Base title="Privacy · Hopper" description="What the Hopper website collects, why, and how to have it deleted." path="/privacy">
  <article class="wrap policy">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <p class="lead">This page covers this website and the Hopper waitlist. Hopper the app reads and keeps what it indexes on your Mac; the app will ship with its own privacy details.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Your email</b>, when you join the waitlist: your address and anything you write in it.</li>
      <li>Nothing else. This site has no analytics and no cookies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>To email you when Hopper is ready and to invite some people to test it early. We don't sell or share your email, and we don't send marketing beyond Hopper's launch and testing.</p>

    <h2>Who handles it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Our email inbox</b> ({site.contact}) holds the waitlist.</li>
      <li><b>GitHub Pages</b> hosts this site. Like any web host, it may log visits for security.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Until Hopper launches publicly and for 12 months after, or until you ask us to delete it, whichever comes first. Reply to any email from us to be removed right away.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact}`}>{site.contact}</a> to see, correct or delete what we hold about you. We reply within 30 days.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 44rem;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
  }
  .updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .lead {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  p,
  ul {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
